Sudoku protocol module provenance
=================================

This directory contains code derived from the Sudoku protocol implementation in:

  H-gripe-proxy
  https://github.com/tanzanite2025/H-gripe-proxy
  revision 9dcb5bc2cbf36d1f13089af09c7536ecbb764787
